  Strings:
  - SearchKey: AGI_Poison_Name
    Content_Kor: "\uB3C5 \uBC14\uB974\uAE30"
    Content_Eng: Venom Blade
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: AGI_Poison_Desc
    Content_Kor: "{0:0.#}\uCD08 \uB3D9\uC548 \uAC80\uC5D0 \uB3C5\uC744 \uBC14\uB985\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uCD5C\uB300 {1:0}\uC911\uCCA9, \uC911\uCCA9\uB2F9 \uCD08\uB2F9 {2:0.#} \uD53C\uD574,
      {3:0.#}\uCD08 \uC9C0\uC18D."
    Content_Eng: Coat your sword for {0:0.#}s. Up to {1:0} stacks, {2:0.#} damage
      per stack per second for {3:0.#}s.
    FormatArgCount: 4
  - SearchKey: CON_Kick_Name
    Content_Kor: "\uBC1C\uCC28\uAE30"
    Content_Eng: Kick
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: CON_Kick_Desc
    Content_Kor: "\uACF5\uACA9\uB825\uC758 {0:0%} \uD53C\uD574\uC640 {1:0.#}m \uBC00\uCE58\uAE30.
      {2:0.#}\uCD08 \uB3D9\uC548 \uC801\uC744 \uB290\uB9AC\uAC8C \uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Content_Eng: Deal {0:0%} attack damage and knock back {1:0.#}m. Slow the target
      for {2:0.#}s.
    FormatArgCount: 3
  - SearchKey: DEF_Taunt_Name
    Content_Kor: "\uB3C4\uBC1C"
    Content_Eng: Taunt
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: DEF_Taunt_Desc
    Content_Kor: "{0:0.#}\uCD08 \uC548\uC5D0 \uC801\uC911\uD55C \uB2E4\uC74C \uACF5\uACA9\uC774
      \uC801\uC744 {1:0.#}\uCD08\uAC04 \uB3C4\uBC1C\uD558\uBA70, \uBC1B\uB294 \uD53C\uD574
      \uAC10\uC18C\xB7\uBC18\uC0AC \uAC15\uD654\uAC00 \uC801\uC6A9\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uB300\uAE30 \uC911 \uBB34\uAE30\uB294 \uC8FC\uD669\uC0C9. \uCFE8\uD0C0\uC784
      {2:0.#}\uCD08."
    Content_Eng: 'Your next hit within {0:0.#}s taunts for {1:0.#}s, reducing incoming
      damage and increasing reflection. The weapon glows orange while ready. Cooldown:
      {2:0.#}s.'
    FormatArgCount: 3
  - SearchKey: POLY_Weapon_Name
    Content_Kor: "\uBB34\uAE30 \uC2A4\uC651"
    Content_Eng: Weapon Swap
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: POLY_Weapon_Desc
    Content_Kor: "\uAC80\uACFC \uD65C\uC744 \uAD50\uCCB4\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. {0:0.#}\uCD08
      \uB3D9\uC548 \uC774\uB3D9 \uC18D\uB3C4\uAC00 \uC99D\uAC00\uD558\uACE0 \uB2E4\uC74C
      \uACF5\uACA9\uC774 \uAC15\uD654\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC88C\uD074\uB9AD\uC744
      \uAE38\uAC8C \uB20C\uB7EC \uD65C\uC744 \uCDA9\uC804\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Content_Eng: Swap between sword and bow. Gain movement speed for {0:0.#}s and
      empower your next hit. Hold attack to draw the bow.
    FormatArgCount: 1
  - SearchKey: POLY_Preset_Name
    Content_Kor: "\uD504\uB9AC\uC14B \uC804\uD658 (\uBBF8\uC0AC\uC6A9)"
    Content_Eng: Reconfigure (unused)
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: POLY_Preset_Desc
    Content_Kor: "\uC774\uC804 \uB370\uC774\uD130 \uD638\uD658\uC6A9 \uC2A4\uD0AC\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uC7A5\uCC29\uD560 \uC218 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Content_Eng: Legacy compatibility skill. Cannot be equipped.
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: POLY_Roll_Name
    Content_Kor: "\uAD6C\uB974\uAE30"
    Content_Eng: Roll
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: POLY_Roll_Desc
    Content_Kor: "\uC804\uBC29\uC73C\uB85C {3:0.##}\uCD08 \uB3D9\uC548 {0:0.#}m \uAD6C\uB985\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uCD5C\uB300 {1:0}\uD68C \uCDA9\uC804, {2:0.#}\uCD08\uB9C8\uB2E4 1\uD68C \uD68C\uBCF5."
    Content_Eng: Roll {0:0.#}m forward in {3:0.##}s. Stores {1:0} charges; recovers
      one every {2:0.#}s.
    FormatArgCount: 4
  - SearchKey: STR_Lifesteal_Name
    Content_Kor: "\uAD11\uD3ED"
    Content_Eng: Bloodlust
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: STR_Lifesteal_Desc
    Content_Kor: "{0:0.#}\uCD08 \uB3D9\uC548 \uACF5\uACA9\uC18D\uB3C4 {1:0%}, \uC774\uB3D9\uC18D\uB3C4
      {2:0%} \uC0C1\uC2B9. \uAC80\uC73C\uB85C \uC900 \uD53C\uD574\uC758 {3:0%}\uB97C
      \uCCB4\uB825\uC73C\uB85C \uD68C\uBCF5\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Content_Eng: Gain {1:0%} attack speed and {2:0%} movement speed for {0:0.#}s.
      Heal for {3:0%} of sword damage dealt.
    FormatArgCount: 4
  - SearchKey: TACT_Preset_Name
    Content_Kor: "\uD504\uB9AC\uC14B \uC804\uD658"
    Content_Eng: Reconfigure
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: TACT_Preset_Desc
    Content_Kor: "\uC800\uC7A5\uD55C \uB2A5\uB825\uCE58 \uBC30\uBD84\uC73C\uB85C
      \uC804\uD658\uD558\uACE0 \uC8FC \uB2A5\uB825\uCE58\uC5D0 \uB9DE\uB294 \uBCF4\uB108\uC2A4\uB97C
      \uBC1B\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uB2E4\uC2DC \uC0AC\uC6A9\uD558\uBA74 \uC6D0\uB798
      \uBC30\uBD84\uC73C\uB85C \uB3CC\uC544\uAC11\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Content_Eng: Switch to your saved stat preset and gain a bonus based on its primary
      stat. Use again to return.
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: TACT_Dash_Name
    Content_Kor: "\uB300\uC2DC"
    Content_Eng: Dash
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: TACT_Dash_Desc
    Content_Kor: "\uC804\uBC29\uC73C\uB85C {3:0.##}\uCD08 \uB3D9\uC548 {0:0.#}m \uB300\uC2DC\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uCD5C\uB300 {1:0}\uD68C \uCDA9\uC804, {2:0.#}\uCD08\uB9C8\uB2E4 1\uD68C \uD68C\uBCF5."
    Content_Eng: Dash {0:0.#}m forward in {3:0.##}s. Stores {1:0} charges; recovers
      one every {2:0.#}s.
    FormatArgCount: 4
  - SearchKey: STR_Hook_Name
    Content_Kor: "\uAC08\uACE0\uB9AC"
    Content_Eng: Grappling Hook
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: STR_Hook_Desc
    Content_Kor: "\uC0AC\uAC70\uB9AC {0:0.#}m\uC758 \uAC08\uACE0\uB9AC\uB97C \uB358\uC838
      \uACE0\uC815 \uD53C\uD574 {1:0}\uC744 \uC8FC\uACE0 \uC55E\uC73C\uB85C \uB04C\uC5B4\uC635\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uB04C\uB824\uC624\uB294 \uC801\uC740 \uC2DC\uC804\uC790\uB97C \uBC14\uB77C\uBCF4\uBA70
      \uC774\uB3D9\xB7\uACF5\uACA9\uD560 \uC218 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uC2DC\uC804\uC790\uB3C4
      \uD68C\uC218\uAE4C\uC9C0 \uC774\uB3D9\xB7\uACF5\uACA9 \uBD88\uAC00."
    Content_Eng: Throw a hook up to {0:0.#}m for {1:0} fixed damage and pull the
      target toward you. The target faces you and cannot move or attack during the
      pull. You cannot move or attack until retrieval.
    FormatArgCount: 2
  - SearchKey: STR_WarCry_Name
    Content_Kor: "\uD798\uCC2C \uD568\uC131"
    Content_Eng: Rallying Cry
    FormatArgCount: 0
  - SearchKey: STR_WarCry_Desc
    Content_Kor: "{0:0.#}\uCD08 \uB3D9\uC548 \uC774\uB3D9 \uC18D\uB3C4\uAC00 \uAE30\uBCF8\uC758
      {1:0%}, \uBC1B\uB294 \uD53C\uD574\uAC00 {2:0%}\uAC00 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Content_Eng: For {0:0.#}s, movement speed becomes {1:0%} and incoming damage
      becomes {2:0%} of normal.
    FormatArgCount: 3
  - SearchKey: SHARED_Charge_Name
