    Content_Eng: Charge up to {0:0.#}s. Start at {3:0%} walk speed; reach {4:0%}
      base AGI-specialist speed in {1:0.#}s. Damage and stun each enemy once for
      {2:0.#}s without stopping. Jump, attack or a skill key ends charge.
