      {0:0}\uAC1C, {1:0.#}\uCD08\uB9C8\uB2E4 1\uAC1C \uCDA9\uC804. \uACF5\uACA9\uB825\uC758
      {2:0%} \uD53C\uD574\uC640 \uB3C5 1\uC911\uCCA9. \uB2E4\uC2DC \uD0A4\uB97C \uB204\uB974\uBA74
      \uCDE8\uC18C."
    Content_Eng: Ready with the skill key, then left-click to throw. Walk and crouch
      while ready. Holds {0:0} knives; one recharges every {1:0.#}s. Deals {2:0%}
      attack damage and one poison stack. Press the skill key again to cancel.
